### Sanity check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 1. Resolve a location before signing up (public)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/location/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latitude": 26.8467, "longitude": 80.9462 }

### 2. Register (location is required)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Akash Kumar",
  "email": "akash@example.com",
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "password": "ResQai2026",
  "role": "CITIZEN",
  "location": { "latitude": 26.8467, "longitude": 80.9462, "radiusKm": 300 }
}

### 3. Log in
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "akash@example.com", "password": "ResQai2026" }

### 4. Who am I
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 5. Disaster News feed, scoped to the registered location
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/disaster-news/feed?radiusKm=300&days=90
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 6. Live events only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/disaster-news/live
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 7. Previous events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/disaster-news/history?days=180
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 8. Reports and headlines
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/disaster-news/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 9. Move the registered location
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/location
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "city": "Varanasi", "state": "Uttar Pradesh", "country": "India", "radiusKm": 250 }

### 10. Rotate the refresh token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}" }
